1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,500
JEE Main mein sirf 50 din bache hain

2
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:05,500
aur tumhari preparation ki gaand pehle
se hi fati padi hai.

3
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:08,500
Physics mein backlog ka Himalaya khada hai,

4
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:12,000
Chemistry mein mole concept tumhari
maa-behen ek kar raha hai,

5
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:15,500
aur Maths ki notebook mein question se
zyada tumhara naam likha hua hai.

6
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:18,500
Lekin confidence dekho gaandu ka.

7
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:22,500
YouTube par search kar raha hai, 50 days
mein zero se 99 percentile kaise laayein.

8
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:26,500
Arey bhosadi ke, padhai ki hai jhaant barabar aur
sapne dekh raha hai IIT Bombay CSE ke.

9
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:30,600
Kya ukhad lega sirf motivational
videos dekh kar, jhaantu?

10
00:00:30,600 --> 00:00:33,100
Aaj hum 50 din ka roadmap banayenge,

11
00:00:33,100 --> 00:00:36,100
lekin koi fake motivation nahi,
koi selection ki guarantee nahi.

12
00:00:36,100 --> 00:00:38,600
Seedha reality check milega,

13
00:00:38,600 --> 00:00:42,100
aur jahan zaroorat padegi wahan tumhari
preparation ki gaand bhi maarenge.

14
00:00:42,100 --> 00:00:44,100
Sabse pehle samajh lo,

15
00:00:44,100 --> 00:00:48,100
50 din mein zero se start karke 99
percentile laane ki guarantee koi nahi de sakta.

16
00:00:48,100 --> 00:00:51,600
Lekin apne current level ko
improve karna, syllabus cover karna,

17
00:00:51,600 --> 00:00:54,600
aur exam ke liye behtar
prepare hona bilkul possible hai.

18
00:00:54,600 --> 00:00:59,100
Toh apni gaand se IIT ka imaginary
admission letter nikalo aur dhyaan se suno.

19
00:00:59,100 --> 00:01:00,840
Pehle 15 din.

20
00:01:00,840 --> 00:01:03,340
Syllabus coverage. Agle das din PYQs.

21
00:01:03,340 --> 00:01:07,340
Uske baad pandrah din
mock tests aur analysis.

22
00:01:07,340 --> 00:01:10,340
Aur last ke das din
revision aur question practice.

23
00:01:10,340 --> 00:01:12,340
Total pachaas din.

24
00:01:12,340 --> 00:01:15,840
Ek bhi din faltu ki
bakchodi mein barbaad nahi karna.

25
00:01:15,840 --> 00:01:19,340
Ab pehle pandrah din mein
maximum syllabus cover karna hai.

26
00:01:19,340 --> 00:01:22,340
Aur yahan sabse pehla chutiyapa mat karna.

27
00:01:22,340 --> 00:01:26,340
Har chapter ke pandrah ghante ke
detailed lectures dekhne baith gaye,

28
00:01:26,340 --> 00:01:28,340
Toh pandrah din mein syllabus
toh complete nahi hoga,

29
00:01:28,340 --> 00:01:30,560
Lekin YouTube par tumhari watch history dekh
kar log tumhe professor samajhne lagenge.

30
00:01:30,560 --> 00:01:34,360
Are lund ke baal, padhne aaye
ho ya lectures collect karne?

31
00:01:34,360 --> 00:01:38,560
High weightage chapters, important concepts aur
exam oriented preparation par focus karo.

32
00:01:38,560 --> 00:01:40,560
Jin chapters ke basics aate hain

33
00:01:40,560 --> 00:01:43,060
unhe dobara zero se padhne
ka natak mat karo.

34
00:01:43,060 --> 00:01:45,560
Aur jin chapters mein bilkul zero ho,

35
00:01:45,560 --> 00:01:48,060
unke liye focused lectures ya
one shots use karo.

36
00:01:48,060 --> 00:01:51,060
Lekin ek baat apne dimaag mein ghusa lo,

37
00:01:51,060 --> 00:01:54,060
one shot dekhna chapter
complete karna nahi hota.

38
00:01:54,060 --> 00:01:56,060
Lecture dekh kar question solve nahi kiye,

39
00:01:56,060 --> 00:01:58,060
toh tumne bas teacher ka chehra dekha hai.

40
00:01:58,060 --> 00:02:00,500
Knowledge tumhare dimaag mein
ghusi hai jhaant barabar.

41
00:02:00,500 --> 00:02:03,000
Physics mein concepts ke
saath numericals lagao.

42
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:07,000
Chemistry mein reactions, NCERT aur
important exceptions par focus karo.

43
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:10,500
Maths mein formulae ratne ke bajaye
questions par apply karna seekho.

44
00:02:10,500 --> 00:02:13,500
Aur teeno subjects ko daily time do.

45
00:02:13,500 --> 00:02:18,000
Sirf favorite subject padhkar baaki do
subjects ko anaath mat bana dena,

46
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:19,060
bhadve.

47
00:02:19,060 --> 00:02:22,260
Ab agle das din tumhare
asli baap hain, PYQs.

48
00:02:22,260 --> 00:02:26,060
Previous year questions. Ab tumhare paas pandrah
din nahi, sirf das din hain.

49
00:02:26,060 --> 00:02:29,860
Isliye random questions ke peeche
apni gaand mat ghisna.

50
00:02:29,860 --> 00:02:33,560
Selected recent years ke
PYQs chapter-wise solve karo.

51
00:02:33,560 --> 00:02:37,260
Pehle important aur strong chapters
ke questions complete karo,

52
00:02:37,260 --> 00:02:40,860
phir weak chapters ke selected
questions par focus karo.

53
00:02:40,860 --> 00:02:44,560
Roz lagbhag assi se ek sau bees
quality questions ka target rakh sakte ho,

54
00:02:44,560 --> 00:02:47,560
apne current level ke according. Aur agar
ek sau questions nahi ho rahe,

55
00:02:47,560 --> 00:02:49,870
toh zabardasti notebook mein ek
sau tick mat lagana.

56
00:02:49,870 --> 00:02:52,870
Saale question solve karna
hai, attendance nahi lagani.

57
00:02:52,870 --> 00:02:55,870
Har question ke baad teen sawaal
pucho: concept kya use hua?

58
00:02:55,870 --> 00:02:58,870
Meri mistake kaha hui? Kya
main ise bina solution dekhe

59
00:02:58,870 --> 00:03:01,870
dobara solve kar sakta hoon? Aur
solution dekh kar ye mat bolna,

60
00:03:01,870 --> 00:03:04,870
'Are bhai ye toh aata tha'.
Aata tha toh phir question ne

61
00:03:04,870 --> 00:03:07,870
tumhari gaand kyun maari, chootiye? Solution
dekh kar toh har gaandu

62
00:03:07,870 --> 00:03:10,870
Einstein ban jaata hai. Asli aukaat
tab pata chalti hai jab

63
00:03:10,870 --> 00:03:13,870
solution band karke khud solve karte
ho. Jo questions galat hue,

64
00:03:13,870 --> 00:03:16,870
unhe mistake notebook mein note
karo. Ab agle pandrah din

65
00:03:16,870 --> 00:03:19,560
mock test ke naam.

66
00:03:19,560 --> 00:03:22,060
Yahan tumhara asli post-mortem shuru hoga.

67
00:03:22,060 --> 00:03:26,060
Full-length mock tests do, timer lagao
aur actual exam environment mein baitho.

68
00:03:26,060 --> 00:03:29,060
Lagbhag 8 se 12 quality
mock tests ka target rakho

69
00:03:29,060 --> 00:03:32,060
apne available time aur
preparation level ke according.

70
00:03:32,060 --> 00:03:34,560
Lekin unka analysis ignore mat karna.

71
00:03:34,560 --> 00:03:37,360
Ek mock test dene mein
teen ghante lagte hain,

72
00:03:37,360 --> 00:03:40,360
lekin uske baad analysis bhi karna padega.

73
00:03:40,360 --> 00:03:43,560
Kaunse questions galat hue?
Kahan calculation mistake hui?

74
00:03:43,560 --> 00:03:47,560
Kaunse questions aate hue bhi chhod diye?
Kahan faaltu mein 10 minute barbaad kiye?

75
00:03:47,560 --> 00:03:51,110
Aur kaunse chapters baar-baar tumhari izzat
ka bhaji-pala bana rahe hain.

76
00:03:51,110 --> 00:03:54,110
Bhai mock test mein marks
kam aana problem nahi hai,

77
00:03:54,110 --> 00:03:57,610
har test mein same galti repeat
karna ek number ka chutyapa hai.

78
00:03:57,610 --> 00:04:00,610
Aur agar 200 marks aa
rahe hain toh congratulations,

79
00:04:00,610 --> 00:04:04,110
lund ke baadshah, lekin apni
gaand zameen par rakho.

80
00:04:04,110 --> 00:04:07,610
Ek mock test mein 200
laakar Instagram story lagane se,

81
00:04:07,610 --> 00:04:11,610
IIT ka director tumhari gaand
mein medal daalne nahi aayega.

82
00:04:11,610 --> 00:04:14,610
Har mock ke baad apni mistakes analyze karo,

83
00:04:14,610 --> 00:04:17,110
jo chapter weak hai usko revise karo,

84
00:04:17,110 --> 00:04:19,610
jo question galat hua
usko dobara solve karo.

85
00:04:19,610 --> 00:04:21,690
Sirf test dene se selection nahi hota,
test se seekhne se improvement hota hai.

86
00:04:21,700 --> 00:04:24,700
Ab last ke das din, ye
tumhara final revision phase hai,

87
00:04:24,700 --> 00:04:28,500
aur yahan naye-naye resources collect karne wale
jhaantu log apna muh band rakhein.

88
00:04:28,500 --> 00:04:31,900
Koi nayi reference book nahi, koi
random 40-hour lecture series nahi,

89
00:04:31,900 --> 00:04:35,700
aur koi aisa chapter nahi jiske peeche apni
poori revision ki maa-behen ek kar do.

90
00:04:35,700 --> 00:04:39,200
Ab focus hoga revision, mistakes
aur question practice par.

91
00:04:39,200 --> 00:04:42,700
Formula sheets revise karo, Chemistry ki
important reactions aur facts revise karo.

92
00:04:42,700 --> 00:04:46,200
Physics ke concepts aur formulae revise karo, Maths
ke important question patterns dobara solve karo.

93
00:04:46,200 --> 00:04:52,390
Aur jo questions pehle galat hue
the unhe phir se attempt karo.

94
00:04:52,390 --> 00:04:56,190
Roz apni mistake notebook kholo aur
dekho ki pichle 40 dino mein

95
00:04:56,190 --> 00:04:58,890
kitni baar ek hi chutiyapa repeat kiya hai.

96
00:04:58,890 --> 00:05:01,890
Ab boards aur JEE dono
manage karne wale badve suno.

97
00:05:01,890 --> 00:05:05,890
Boards ko completely ignore karna bhi bewakoofi hai,
aur JEE ko side mein rakhna bhi.

98
00:05:05,890 --> 00:05:09,890
Dono ka syllabus kaafi overlap karta hai,
isliye concepts ko smartly prepare karo.

99
00:05:09,890 --> 00:05:13,890
Lekin boards ke liye writing practice, derivations
aur prescribed syllabus ko bhi time do.

100
00:05:13,890 --> 00:05:17,390
Aisa nahi ki JEE ke chakkar mein
boards ke din answer sheet par

101
00:05:17,390 --> 00:05:20,390
apna naam likh kar aa jao chutiye.

102
00:05:20,390 --> 00:05:23,190
Aur ab sabse bada chutiyapa,
16 ghante padhne ka obsession.

103
00:05:23,190 --> 00:05:26,390
Bhai 16 ghante ki study story
lagane se selection nahi hota,

104
00:05:26,390 --> 00:05:28,690
kisi topper ka time table copy karne se

105
00:05:28,690 --> 00:05:31,190
uska dimaag tumhare andar
transfer nahi hone wala.

106
00:05:31,190 --> 00:05:34,690
Uske time table mein 14 ghante padhai hai,
toh tum bhi 14 ghante baith gaye.

107
00:05:34,690 --> 00:05:38,190
Agle din aankhein laal, dimaag dead
aur syllabus wahi ka wahi.

108
00:05:38,190 --> 00:05:40,690
Kya ukhad liye gaandu?

109
00:05:40,690 --> 00:05:43,690
Apni capacity ke according
realistic time table banao.

110
00:05:43,690 --> 00:05:46,690
School jaate ho toh available
time mein focus study karo.

111
00:05:46,690 --> 00:05:49,690
Dropper ho toh extra time
ka properly use karo.

112
00:05:49,690 --> 00:05:51,690
Lekin 12 ghante padhai
ka screenshot upload karke

113
00:05:51,690 --> 00:05:53,970
do ghante padhne wale bhosadi ke mat banna.

114
00:05:53,970 --> 00:05:56,970
Aur please, motivational videos
ki shopping band karo.

115
00:05:56,970 --> 00:06:00,970
Tumhare phone mein itne motivational videos
hain ki agar unse selection milta

116
00:06:00,970 --> 00:06:04,970
toh ab tak tumhara AIR
negative mein aa chuka hota.

117
00:06:04,970 --> 00:06:07,970
Subah motivation, dopahar motivation,
raat ko motivation.

118
00:06:07,970 --> 00:06:11,970
Raat ko motivation, raat ko motivation
nahi, discipline ki zaroorat hai.

119
00:06:11,970 --> 00:06:15,470
Aur Telegram par har doosre bande
ko topper samajhna band karo.

120
00:06:15,470 --> 00:06:18,970
Koi bol raha hai 16 ghante padhta hoon, koi
bol raha hai 250 marks aa rahe hain.

121
00:06:18,970 --> 00:06:20,060
Abey jhaantu!

122
00:06:20,060 --> 00:06:22,560
Uske preparation dekhne se tera
syllabus complete nahi hone wala.

123
00:06:22,560 --> 00:06:25,060
Apna timetable banao, apne
targets complete karo,

124
00:06:25,060 --> 00:06:28,060
aur apni progress ko kal ke
apne score se compare karo.

125
00:06:28,060 --> 00:06:30,560
Ab ek baat dhyan se suno.
50 din bahut kam hain,

126
00:06:30,560 --> 00:06:34,060
lekin itne bhi kam nahi ki
tum abhi se haar maan kar

127
00:06:34,060 --> 00:06:36,560
apni gaand pakad kar baith jao.

128
00:06:36,560 --> 00:06:39,560
Pehle 15 din syllabus par kaam karo,

129
00:06:39,560 --> 00:06:42,060
agle 10 din PYQs par,

130
00:06:42,060 --> 00:06:45,060
uske baad 15 din mock
tests aur analysis par,

131
00:06:45,060 --> 00:06:47,560
aur last ke 10 din
revision aur weak areas par.

132
00:06:47,560 --> 00:06:49,060
Total 50 din. Ab rona band,
excuses band aur bakchodi band.

133
00:06:49,060 --> 00:06:52,060
Phone side mein rakho, notebook kholo
aur pehla question solve karo,

134
00:06:52,060 --> 00:06:56,060
kyunki exam ke din tumhari YouTube search
history nahi, tumhari preparation kaam aayegi.

135
00:06:56,060 --> 00:07:00,060
Aur jo abhi bhi comment section mein AIR
1 banne ki acting kar rahe hain,

136
00:07:00,060 --> 00:07:03,560
unse bas itna kehna hai, bhai comment
mein gaand ghisne se selection nahi hota,

137
00:07:03,560 --> 00:07:07,060
bhosadi waalo, gaand mein dum hai
toh mock test mein dikhao.

138
00:07:07,060 --> 00:07:11,060
Ab padhai karo, apna dimaag lagao aur
NTA ke bharose apni zindagi mat chalao.

139
00:07:11,060 --> 00:07:14,590
Milte hain agle video mein, bye-bye saalo!

